CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_PBSwitch "Switch signal which indicates when the parking brake is set. In general the switch actuated by the operator's park brake control, whether a pedal, lever or other control mechanism  (see also SPN 619 and 5275).";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_CruiseCtrlPauseSwitch "Swch signal which indicates the Postn of the Cruise Ctrl Pause Swch used on Rmot CruiseCtrl applications.";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_WheelBasedVehSpd "Speed of the vehicle as calculated from wheel or tailshaft speed.";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CruiseCtrlActive "Cruise Ctrl is Swched on. It is not ensured that the Eng is Ctrlled by cruise Ctrl, as in the caseof a large Drv's demand the Eng is Ctrlled by the Drv while cruise Ctrl is active (maximumselection of cruise Ctrl and Drv's demand). The cruise Ctrl is set to 0 if a Swch off conditionoccurs.";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_CruiseCtrlEnbSwitch "Swch signal which indicates that it is possible to manage the cruise Ctrl function";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_BrakeSwitch "Swch signal which indicates that the Drv operated Brk foot pedal is being pressed. This Brk footpedal is Ctrlling the Vhcls' service Brk (total Vhcl braking application, not park Brks). It isnecessary for safe drivetrain behavior that the Swch activates before the physical braking componentsare activated (i.e. Disengage the cruise Ctrl function prior to the activation of friction Brks).";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_ClutchSwitch "Swch signal which indicates that the clutch pedal is being pressed. It is necessary for a safe drivetrainbehavior that the clutch Swch is set before the clutch is opened (cruise Ctrl function).";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_CruiseCtrlSetSwitch "Swch signal of the cruise Ctrl activator which indicates that the activator is in the Postn 'set.'";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_CruiseCtrlResumeSwitch "Swch signal of the cruise Ctrl activator which indicates that the activator is in the Postn 'resume.'";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_CruiseCtrlSetSpd "Value of set (chosen) velocity of velocity Ctrl Sys.";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_PTOManagmentState "用于表示当前PTO处于的状态";
CM_ SG_ 2566844672 CCVS1_CruiseCtrlState "This parameter is used to indicate the Curr Sts, or mode, of operation by the cruise Ctrl device";
CM_ SG_ 2565866755 ETC2_TransSelectedGear "The gear that the transmission will attempt to achieve during the current shift if a shift is in progress, or the next shift if one
is pending";
CM_ SG_ 2565866755 ETC2_TransActualGearRatio "Actual ratio of input shaft speed to output shaft speed";
CM_ SG_ 2565866755 ETC2_TransCurrentGear "The gear currently engaged in the transmission or the last gear engaged while the transmission is in the process of
shifting to the new or selected gear";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 DM1_EPB_ProtectLamp "保护灯状态";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 DM1_EPB_AmberWarningLamp "琥珀色警示灯状态";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 DM1_EPB_RedStopLamp "红色停止灯状态";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 DM1_EPB_MalfunctionIndicatorLamp "故障指示灯状态";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 DM1_EPB_SAELamp_Reserved "SAE保留分配灯状态";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 DM1_EPB_SPN8_LeastSignificantBit "故障SPN的8个最低有效位（CM=0）
（第8位是最高有效位）";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 DM1_EPB_SPN_secondByteOfSPN "故障SPN的第二字节（CM=0）
（第8位是最高有效位）";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 DM1_EPB_FMI "FMI用于定义对SPN标识的子系统检测到的故障的类型（第5位是最高有效位）";
CM_ SG_ 2566834768 DM1_EPB_SPN3MmostSignificantBit "SPN， 3个最高有效位
（第8位是最高有效位）";
