CM_ SG_ 2364539648 EEC2_AccelPedalKickdownSwitch "Switch signal which indicates whether the accelerator pedal kickdown switch is opened or closed.";
CM_ SG_ 2364539648 EEC2_AccelPedalPstn "The ratio of actual accelerator pedal position to maximum pedal position. Although it is used as aninput to determine powertrain demand, it also provides anticipatory information to transmission andASR algorithms about driver actions.";
CM_ SG_ 2364539648 EEC2_PercentLoadAtCurrentSpd "The ratio of actual engine percent torque (indicated) to maximum indicated torque available at thecurrent engine speed, clipped to zero torque during engine braking";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1_ACCE_EngOvrrdCtrlMode "The override Ctrl mode defines which sort of Cmd is used.
发动机控制模式";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1_ACCE_ReqSpdCtrlConditions "This mode tells the Eng Ctrl Sys the governor characteristics that are desired during speed Ctrl.
速度控制时用的
0x0:针对传动系统脱离和非锁定情况进行的瞬态优化
0x1:为传动系统脱离和非锁定条件优化的稳定性
0x2:针对传动系统啮合和/或处于锁定状态1的稳定性进行了优化
0x3:为传动系统啮合和/或处于锁定状态而优化的稳定性2";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1_ACCE_OvrrdCtrlModePriority "This field is used as an input to the Eng or retarder to determine thepriority of the Override Ctrl Mode received in theTorque/Speed Ctrl message (see PGN 0). The default is 11 (Low priority). It is not required to use the same priority duringthe entire override function. For example, the transmission can use priority 01 (High priority) during a shift, but can set thepriority to 11 (Low priority) at the end of the shift to allow traction Ctrl to also interact with the torque limit of the Eng.
该字段被用作发动机或减速机的输入，以确定在转矩/速度控制消息中接收到的超驰控制模式的优先级(参见PGN 0)。默认值是11(低优先级)。在整个override函数中不需要使用相同的优先级。例如，变速器在换挡时可以使用优先级01(高优先级)，但在换挡结束时可以将优先级设置为11(低优先级)，以便牵引力控制也可以与发动机的扭矩限制相互作用。";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1_ACCE_EngReqTrqOrTrqLim "Parameter provided to the Eng or retarder in the torque/speed Ctrl message for Ctrlling or limiting the output torque.Reqed torque to the Eng is measured in indicated torque as a percentage of reference Eng torque. This is the Engtorque at which the Eng is expected to operate if the torque Ctrl mode is active or the Eng torque which the Eng is notexpected to exceed if the torque limit mode is active
在转矩/速度控制信息中提供给发动机或减速机的参数，用于控制或限制输出转矩。要求的发动机转矩是用指示转矩作为参考发动机转矩的百分比来测量的。这是在转矩控制模式为Auto模式时发动机预期运行的发动机转矩，或在转矩限制模式为Auto模式时发动机预期不会超过的发动机转矩";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1_ACCE_TransRate "This parameter indicates the transmission rate at which the sending device will transmit the TSC1 message. The Eng shall Adj its timeout for TSC1 messages accordingly. Variable TSC1 transmission rates shall only apply to messages sent to the Eng.
该参数表示发送设备发送TSC1消息的传输速率。引擎应相应地调整TSC1消息的超时时间。可变的TSC1传输速率仅适用于发送到发动机的消息。";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1_ACCE_CtrlPurpose "Sts signal which indicates which Ctrl mode the sending device is using to generate the TSC1 Cmd. Note that the modes are not in prioritized order. Not all modes may be relevant for a given device. Some devices may not implement all functions. The TSC1 Ctrl purpose shall only apply to messages sent to the Eng.
指示发送设备使用哪种控制模式来生成TSC1命令。注意，这些模式并不是按照优先顺序排列的。并非所有模式都适用于特定设备。有些设备可能不能实现所有的功能。TSC1的控制用途仅适用于发送给发动机的消息。";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1_ACCE_EngReqTrqHR "This parameter displays an additional torque in percent of the reference Eng torque.
发动机扭矩请求的小数部分";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1_ACCE_MessageCounter "The message counter is used to detect situations where the transmitting ECU malfunction repeats the same frame all the time.The receiver of the formation may use the counter parameter to detect this situation. The transmitting device will increase themessage counter in every cycle. The message counter will count from 0 to 7 and then wrap. The values 0x8 thru 0xE are SAEreserved and should be ignored by the receiver.Value 0xF (all bits set to 1) will indicate that the message counter is not available.For co";
CM_ SG_ 2348810282 TSC1_ACCE_MessageChecksum "The message checksum is used to verify the signal path from the transmitting device to the receiving device.The message checksum is calculated using the first 7 data bytes, the message counter and the bytes of the messageidentifier. It is calculated as follows:Checksum = (Byte1 + Byte2 + Byte3 + Byte4 + Byte5 + Byte6 + Byte7 + message counter & 0x0F + message ID low byte +message ID mid low byte + message ID mid high byte + message ID high byte)Message Checksum = (((Checksum >> 6) & 0x03) + (Checksum >>3)";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 XBR2_ExtAccelDemand "Parameter provided to the Brk Sys from external sources. This is the Acc which the Brk Sys is expected torealize. It is specified as an absolute Acc in reference to the road. Pstv values lead to increasing Vhcl speed,Ngtv values lead to decreasing Vhcl speed.Note: Normally only the Ngtv data range is used,but e.g. in case of downhilldriving also Pstv values are possible.";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 XBR2_EBIMode "The XBR EBI (Endurance Brk Integration) Mode is used as an input for the Brk Sys to prescribe the use of enduranceBrks like retarders or Eng Brks.";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 XBR2_Priority "The XBR Priority is used as an input to the Brk Sys to manage the priority of overlapping external and internal Reqs.";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 XBR2_CtrlMode "The XBR Ctrl Mode is used as an input to the Brk Sys and defines how the external Acc demand has to berealized.";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 XBR2_MessageCounter "The XBR message counter is to verify the signal path from the demanding device to the brakecontroller on electronic brake systems";
CM_ SG_ 2349075360 XBR2_MessageChecksum "The XBR message checksum is used to verify the signal path from the demanding device to the brakecontroller on electronic brake systems.The 4 bit XBR message checksum is calculated using the first 7 data bytes, the 4 bit message counterand the bytes of the message identifier. It is calculated as follows:Checksum = (Byte1 + Byte2 + Byte3 + Byte4 + Byte5 + Byte6 + Byte7 + message counter&0x0F +message ID low byte + message ID mid low byte + message ID mid high byte + message ID highbyte)XBR Message Checksum = ((Checksum >> 4) + Checksum) & 0x0F";
CM_ SG_ 2348875814 TC1_ADU_TransReqGear "Negative values are reverse gears, positive values are forward gears, zero is neutral.";
CM_ BO_ 2566864170 "Electronic Parking Brk 2";
CM_ SG_ 2566864170 EPB2_ExtPressDemandForEPB "External pressure demand for Electronic Parking Brake
FE: Error
FF: Not available";
CM_ SG_ 2566864170 EPB2_ExtInhibitReqForPBRelease "External inhibition request for Parking Brake release";
CM_ SG_ 2566864170 EPB2_ExtInhibitReqForPBApply "External inhibition request for Parking Brake application";
CM_ SG_ 2566864170 EPB2_ExtApplyReqForEPB "External application request for Electronic Parking Brake";
CM_ SG_ 2566864170 EPB2_ExtReleaseReqForEPB "External release request for Electronic Parking Brake";
CM_ SG_ 2566864170 EPB2_AutoDrvState "智驾模式";
CM_ SG_ 2566864170 EPB2_MessageCounter "The message counter is to verify the signal path from the demanding device to the brake controller onelectronic brake systems.";
CM_ SG_ 2566864170 EPB2_MessageChecksum "Checksum = (Byte1 + Byte2 + Byte3 + Byte4 + Byte5 + Byte6 + Byte7 + message counter&0x0F +message ID low byte + message ID mid low byte + message ID mid high byte + message ID highbyte)Message Checksum = ((Checksum >> 4) + Checksum) & 0x0F";
CM_ SG_ 2566857510 ADU1_ADUStat "表示ADU实际工作状态。接口说明：VCU接收控制模式为沿变模式， ADU控制需按照周期性发送，且需发送5个连续的控制模式0，然后发送控制模式1.备注：如当前不满足ADU控制模式，（VCU自动驾驶相关状态报文中信号AutoToManualTips会说明不满足的条件），在满足条件后，仍然需要发送5个连续的控制模式0，然后发送控制模式1，才能进入无人模式.";
CM_ SG_ 2566857510 ADU1_ADUTargetSpd "Ego truck target speed";
CM_ SG_ 2566857510 ADU1_ADUBrakeSwitch "ADU发送的制动开关信号";
CM_ SG_ 2566857510 ADU1_ADUTargetAccel "Ego truck target acceleration";
CM_ SG_ 2566858534 ADU_Cmd_FrontWiperSwitchCmd "该信号表示雨刮开关控制命令，用于ADV控制BCM驱动雨刮。";
CM_ SG_ 2566858534 ADU_Cmd_FrontWasherSwitchCmd "该信号表示洗涤开关控制命令，用于ADV控制BCM驱动雨刷。";
CM_ SG_ 2566858534 ADU_Cmd_ADUToBCM "该信号表示ADV对BCM的请求控制命令。";
CM_ SG_ 2566858534 ADU_Cmd_DrvDoor1UnlockReq "该信号表示主驾驶侧车门解闭锁请求，用于ADV控制DCM。";
CM_ SG_ 2566858534 ADU_Cmd_PassengerDoor2UnlockReq "该信号表示副驾驶侧车门解闭锁请求，用于ADV控制DCM。";
CM_ SG_ 2566858534 ADU_Cmd_BackBrakeLightCmd "该信号表示后制动开关，用于ADV控制BCM点亮后制动灯。";
CM_ SG_ 2566858534 ADU_Cmd_HornCmd "该信号用于控制前后喇叭命令。";
CM_ SG_ 2566779431 VCU_Status_VCUMode "表示VCU实际工作模式状态。";
CM_ SG_ 2566779431 VCU_Status_ManualBrakeSwitch "表示VCU发送的制动开关信号。注：只有有人踩下才会变化";
CM_ SG_ 2566779431 VCU_Status_ManualAccelPedalPstn "表示VCU发送的油门开关信号。注：只有有人踩下才会变化";
CM_ SG_ 2566779431 VCU_Status_VCUAutoToManualTips "16个位分别代表不同的条件：
位1：舒适CAN总线关闭；
位2：动力CAN总线关闭；
位3：ADV控制模式报文超时；
位4：ADV扭矩请求报文CS/LC故障；
位5：手刹开关拉下；
位6：挂车手刹开关拉下；
位7：巡航激活；
位8：油门踩下大于一定阈值；
位9：油门踏板故障时；
位10：刹车踏板踩下；
位11：刹车踏板故障时；
位12：智能驾驶功能屏蔽。";
CM_ SG_ 2566779431 VCU_Status_ActualMaxDrivePctTrq "Actual_Max_Available_Drive_Pct_Torque
当前状态下电机能够提供的最大实时相对驱动参考扭矩值的百分比，不包含此时的滑行扭矩值。";
CM_ SG_ 2566769953 OWW_FrontOperatorWiperSwitch "State of operation selected by operator switch for the Wiper in front of the operator position.";
CM_ SG_ 2566769953 OWW_FrontOperatorWasherSwitch "State of operation selected by operator switch for the washer in front of the operator position.";
